#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:65
msgid ""
"Returns the top-level WordPress admin menu of one profile (default: "
"\"default\") in display order: each item's slug, title, whether it is hidden"
" and its preset group. Also returns where the profile's settings come from "
"(source: saved, preset, default, or inherit for a role that uses the default"
" menu), its effective settings (order, hidden, removed separators, separator"
" color, follows_default_order), the preset groups with the slugs no preset "
"pattern names, every profile with the users it applies to, the agency "
"accounts (they always get the default profile) and the age of the menu "
"snapshot. Use it before amswap/update-menu-order to get the exact slugs."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:109
msgid "Update admin menu order"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:110
msgid ""
"Saves the top-level WordPress admin menu of one profile, as the settings "
"page does. profile is \"default\" (agency accounts and roles without a "
"profile) or a role. order lists every slug in the wanted order; put "
"\"separator-amswap\" entries where a separator belongs (they are "
"renumbered); separators of core and plugins that are not in order are "
"removed. For a role profile, leave order out (or set follow_default_order) "
"to follow the default order and only set hidden. hidden replaces the hidden "
"items; leave it out to keep the current ones. separator_color (#rrggbb, \"\""
" for the default) is shared and only accepted for the default profile. Slugs"
" must exist in the menu (see amswap/get-menu); unknown slugs are refused. "
"Afterwards the preset no longer applies to that profile until amswap/reset-"
"menu-order."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:117
msgid ""
"Every top-level slug in the wanted order, with \"separator-amswap\" entries "
"for separators. Required for the default profile."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:121
msgid "Role profiles only: follow the default order and ignore order."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:124
msgid ""
"Slugs to hide from the menu. Leave out to keep the current hidden items."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:128
msgid ""
"Default profile only: separator color as #rrggbb, or \"\" for the admin "
"color scheme default. Leave out to keep the current color."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-amswap-abilities.php:160
